GS
[0.75 0 0 0.75 0 0] CT
1 GC
N
0 0 560 420 re
f
GR
GS
[0.48 0 0 0.48018 0 113.32318] CT
[1 0 0 1 0 0] CT
N
0 -236 M
875 -236 L
875 420 L
0 420 L
0 -236 L
cp
clip
GS
0 0 translate
560 420 scale
